    "body": "## What and why\n\nThe continuous protected update from #2101 passes its surrogate constraints, but all four saved quantized updates fail them. This PR reconstructs those exact updates and attributes the difference, so the next learning change addresses the discrete transaction rather than numerical noise or token-specific exceptions. It changes evidence analysis and documentation only.\n\n## Result\n\nOriginal-parent development episode input245; same15 conditional positions,17 references,380 guard rows and1920 Prefix/Generate coordinates; immutable report `b1d27f7b…` / manifest `cdadd7c5…`.\n\n- All1676 source files authenticated;7680/7680 destination bits and all saved displacements/residuals/objective dots reconstruct exactly.\n- Quarter rounding accounts for90.41–96.33% of defined adverse conversion-stage sums on each radius's violated set. Top10 coordinate pressure shares14.37–41.41%; signed opposing contributions are retained. These are not fractions of native failure.\n- Most screen-violating rows retain positive linearized original margins:101/104,164/170,94/98,90/93. No native retention or guard relaxation follows.\n- KEEP the diagnostic. Joint discrete formation is NOT YET PROMOTED. No model/candidate execution; accepted8/512 unchanged.\n\nNext is a prospectively specified protection-aware joint discrete transaction, with existing surrogate and full native acceptance unchanged. No solver or feasibility result is asserted.\n\n## Exact-head checks and review\n\nFinal head `c9ea4c90373f88cdcfe5de2a09b37f62d611a160` (fresh-main merge preserves both progress-log entries; analyzer/result and other delivery blobs unchanged):\n\n- `python3 docs/labs/quantized-protection-attribution-2026-10-09/analyze.py --self-test`: PASS for ties-away both signs, negative-zero preservation, fractional no-op, clamp, changed tie and shape rejection.\n- Full authenticated saved-artifact reconstruction at identical analyzer/source blob `cf3fac5c…`: PASS; all numerical and per-row/coordinate outputs match first audit exactly, excluding elapsed time. Final invocation5.68s wall,156549120 bytes maxRSS.\n- `python3 docs/figures/geometry/verify_connections.py`:29/29 PASS.\n- `python3 docs/figures/geometry/generate.py`:15 figures regenerated; zero additional diff at exact head.\n- `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py`: PASS; `git diff --check`: PASS.\n- Independent read-only math and adversarial analysis reviews PASS. Adversarial eight-file final exact-head review PASS; it did not rerun the analysis or model.\n- No changed Rust/model path, so no Rust build or generated-behavior rerun is claimed. Queue acknowledgements are not tests.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Checks and review at the exact head above\n- [x] Dated research record and machine-readable result\n- [x] Newest-first current-state entry ending in Next\n- [x] Stale-document scan: protected joint / protected-joint / quantized displacements / quantized-protection; live geometry explanation and matching SVG updated, dated historical results retained\n- [x] STATUS / ROADMAP / #2028 state and best artifact unchanged\n- [x] README capability/headline/mechanism/command unchanged; no running-log edit\n- [x] Claim wording passes\n- [x] After protected merge: fresh-main blob verification, result preservation to iCloud, remote/local branch and worktree removal, hygiene, one milestone result\n\nReferences #2030\n",
